sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Queue Org Admin
    participant C as Console (SPA)
    participant B as Backend API (transportBackEndNative)
    participant DB as Database

    Note over U,B: Registration (first-time user), role 11
    U->>C: Enter full name, phone, email
    C->>B: POST /api/user/createUser (role 11, status)
    B->>DB: Persist pending account
    B-->>C: 200 account created

    Note over U,B: Sign-in by phone + OTP
    U->>C: Enter phone number
    C->>B: POST /api/user/loginUser (no roleId)
    B->>DB: Resolve account role, issue OTP
    B-->>U: SMS OTP (out of band)
    B-->>C: 200 OTP dispatched
    U->>C: Enter six-digit OTP
    C->>B: POST /api/user/verifyUserByOTP (no roleId)
    B->>DB: Validate OTP, open session
    B-->>C: Set-Cookie: httpOnly, SameSite (JWT) + userData
    Note over C: Persist only non-secret userData<br/>(localStorage["queueadmin:user"])

    Note over U,B: Authenticated request
    U->>C: Open queue board
    C->>B: GET /api/queue/status (credentials: include)
    B->>DB: Read queue snapshot
    B-->>C: Entries grouped by vehicle type
    C-->>U: Render FIFO board

    Note over U,B: Session expiry
    B-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
    C-->>U: Global logout, return to sign-in
